"status \(.status) pr \(.diff.prNumber) head \(.diff.headSha) changed \(.diff.summary.changed) added \(.diff.summary.added) removed \(.diff.summary.removed) truncated \(.diff.truncated // 0) failures \(.diff.failures | length) warnings \(.diff.warnings | length)", (.diff.failures[]? | "failure \(.parent): \(.message)"), (.diff.warnings[]? | "warning [\(.level)] \(.rule) on \(.resource): \(.detail)"), (.diff.resources | to_entries[] | "resource \(.key): \(.value.status) \(.value.kind) \(.value.name) +\(.value.add) -\(.value.del) rows \(.value.unified | map(select(.folded != true)) | length) (\(.value.unified | length) with folded context)")
